### ============================================================================
### Pengujian REST API Mahasiswa - Praktikum 5
### Kompatibel dengan: VS Code REST Client Extension / Thunder Client / Postman
### Host Server: http://localhost:8000
### ============================================================================

### 1. GET Semua Mahasiswa
GET http://localhost/ppw5/Judul-5-Pemweb-/api/mahasiswa.php
Accept: application/jsonAccept: application/json

###

### 2. GET Mahasiswa dengan Filter Pencarian
GET http://localhost/ppw5/Judul-5-Pemweb-/api/mahasiswa.php?search=Informatika
Accept: application/jsonAccept: application/json

###

### 3. GET Mahasiswa Berdasarkan ID (Spesifik)
GET http://localhost/ppw5/Judul-5-Pemweb-/api/mahasiswa.php?id=1
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. POST Tambah Mahasiswa Baru
POST http://localhost/ppw5/Judul-5-Pemweb-/api/mahasiswa.php
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nim": "240101088",
  "nama": "Rizky Ramadhan",
  "program_studi": "Teknik Informatika",
  "angkatan": 2024,
  "email": "rizky.ramadhan@example.com"
}

###

### 5. PUT Perbarui Data Mahasiswa Berdasarkan ID
PUT http://localhost/ppw5/Judul-5-Pemweb-/api/mahasiswa.php?id=1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nim": "230101001",
  "nama": "Ahmad Fauzi, S.Kom.",
  "program_studi": "Teknik Informatika",
  "angkatan": 2023,
  "email": "ahmad.fauzi.update@example.com"
}

###

### 6. DELETE Hapus Data Mahasiswa Berdasarkan ID
DELETE http://localhost/ppw5/Judul-5-Pemweb-/api/mahasiswa.php?id=4
Accept: application/json

